.mp4?t=1765976708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEGS ARE OPTIONAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose your legs? You become a rolling torso. It looks ridiculous, but you can still finish the level if you have the skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose your hands? Game over. You need those to climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a mechanic that turns near misses into desperate, hilarious scrambles for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A TWISTED WORLD TOUR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Devil has a strange sense of interior design, you will parkour through:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Circus, The Castle, The Hell, The Ocean, The Savannah and The Tower</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/6fa6c1ba7d828bf409b29a3476c0f436.poster.avif?t=1765976708\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/6fa6c1ba7d828bf409b29a3476c0f436.webm?t=1765976708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/extras/6fa6c1ba7d828bf409b29a3476c0f436.mp4?t=1765976708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["PocketsOfEnergy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308330/61e565ebf4434a6953fb6161a8cf3a6f3166af80/header.jpg?t=1765976708","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class